d a new property to an existing object or change an existing one?":[185,221],"###Q8: How do I add a new property to an existing object or change an existing one?#{1}":[187,221],"###Q9: In the challenge solution `console.log(`${jonas.firstName} has ${jonas.friends.length} friends...`);`, how does `jonas.friends.length` work?":[222,238],"###Q9: In the challenge solution `console.log(`${jonas.firstName} has ${jonas.friends.length} friends...`);`, how does `jonas.friends.length` work?#{1}":[224,238]},"outlinks":[],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[19,30],[44,55],[67,84],[107,127],[141,149],[161,179],[193,218]]},